{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33635","headline":"长安寒食 · 邵谒","name":"长安寒食","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春日照九衢，春风媚罗绮。\n万骑出都门，拥在香尘里。\n莫辞吊枯骨，千载长如此。\n安知今日身，不是昔时鬼。\n但看平地游，亦见摧輈死。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}